OL,3,GNEWSAAction needed to tackle
OL,4,A'biodiversity crisis'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA scrutiny panel has heard Jersey is in
OL,7,Fa "biodiversity crisis", amid concerns
OL,8,Fthe government is not focusing on the
OL,9,Fenvironment enough.
OL,11,FWillie Peggie, government Director of
OL,12,FNatural Environment, said the
OL,13,FEnvironment Department needed time and
OL,14,Fresources for a state of nature report.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
