OL,1,W5j 5Q7+jp5w{j#57kjs15  jjs1
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.* %%** %%**,$-, *(,% ,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAAction needed to tackle
OL,4,A'biodiversity crisis'
OL,5,
OL,6,FPiers Sangan, who runs Sangan Island
OL,7,FConversation, said a biodiversity
OL,8,Fcrisis included more invasive species,
OL,9,Ffewer native species, and a decline in
OL,10,Fthe ecosystem. He said the government
OL,11,Fhad responsibility to ensure the
OL,12,Fenvironment did not "fall by the
OL,13,Fwayside" because it was a "fundamental
OL,14,Fpart of our island".
OL,16,FThe environment minister said policies
OL,17,Fwere being worked on to further protect
OL,18,Fthe environment.
